<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia December producer prices up 1.1 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Slovenia December producer prices up 1.1 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    SLOVENIA PRODUCER PRICES	Dec	Nov     Dec95</p>
<p>    monthly change (percent)     +1.1     +0.4     +1.2</p>
<p>    Yr/yr change (percent)	 +5.8     +5.9     +7.9</p>
<p>-- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
